"விலைப்","tr":"vilaip"}]},{"text":"பெண்டே","tr":"peṇṭē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பெண்","tr":"peṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டே","tr":"ṭē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"நிறப்புடைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"நிறப்புடைக்கு","lemma":"நிறப்புடைக்கு","gloss":"to the blow on the chest"}],"gloss":"to the blow on the chest","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஒல்கா","parts":[{"text":"ஒல்கா","lemma":"olku","gloss":"not flinching"}],"gloss":"unflinching"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"yāṉai","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"},{"surface":"மேலோன்","parts":[{"text":"மேல்","lemma":"mēl","gloss":"upon"},{"text":"ஓன்","lemma":"ōṉ","gloss":"he who is"}],"gloss":"he who is on top"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குறும்பர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"குறும்பர்","lemma":"kuṟumpar","gloss":"enemies"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to the enemies"},{"surface":"எறியும்","parts":[{"text":"எறியும்","lemma":"eṟi","gloss":"beating"}],"gloss":"beating"},{"surface":"ஏவல்","parts":[{"text":"ஏவல்","lemma":"ēval","gloss":"command"}],"gloss":"commanding"},{"surface":"தண்ணுமை","parts":[{"text":"தண்ணுமை","lemma":"taṇṇumai","gloss":"battle drum"}],"gloss":"battle drum"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நாண்","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"nāṇ","gloss":"honour"}],"gloss":"honour"},{"surface":"உடை","parts":[{"text":"உடை","lemma":"uṭai","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"possessing"},{"surface":"மாக்கட்கு","parts":[{"text":"மாக்கள்","lemma":"mākkaḷ","gloss":"people"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to the people"},{"surface":"இரங்கும்","parts":[{"text":"இரங்கும்","lemma":"iraṅku","gloss":"sounds"}],"gloss":"sounds"},{"surface":"ஆயின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"āyiṉ","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எம்மினும்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"yam","gloss":"us"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"than"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even more than us"},{"surface":"பேர்","parts":[{"text":"பேர்","lemma":"pēr","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"great"},{"surface":"எழில்","parts":[{"text":"எழில்","lemma":"eḻil","gloss":"beauty"}],"gloss":"beauty"},{"surface":"இழந்து","parts":[{"text":"இழந்து","lemma":"iḻa","gloss":"having lost"}],"gloss":"having lost"},{"surface":"வினை","parts":[{"text":"வினை","lemma":"viṉai","gloss":"work"}],"gloss":"work"},{"surface":"எனப்","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"saying"},{"text":"ப்","lemma":"p","gloss":"glide"}],"gloss":"saying"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிறர்","parts":[{"text":"பிறர்","lemma":"piṟar","gloss":"others"}],"gloss":"others'"},{"surface":"மனை","parts":[{"text":"மனை","lemma":"maṉai","gloss":"house"}],"gloss":"house"},{"surface":"புகுவள்","parts":[{"text":"புகு","lemma":"puku","gloss":"enter"},{"text":"வள்","lemma":"vaḷ","gloss":"she will"}],"gloss":"she will enter"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"kol","gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"clitic of wonder"}],"gloss":"will she indeed?"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அளியள்","parts":[{"text":"அளி","lemma":"aḷi","gloss":"pity"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"aḷ","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"she is pitiable"},{"surface":"தானே","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"tāṉ","gloss":"indeed"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed herself"},{"surface":"பூவிலைப்","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"pū","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"விலை","lemma":"vilai","gloss":"selling"},{"text":"ப்","lemma":"p","gloss":"glide"}],"gloss":"flower-selling"},{"surface":"பெண்டே","parts":[{"text":"பெண்டு","lemma":"peṇṭu","gloss":"woman"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"woman"}]}],"literal":"The rider of the elephant that does not flinch from blows to its chest / the commanding battle drum beaten to strike the enemies / if it sounds to the people possessing honour / losing her great beauty even more than us, saying 'it is my work' / will she enter the houses of others? / She is indeed pitiable, the flower-selling woman!","translation":"The rider of the elephant that never flinches from blows to its chest beats the commanding battle drum to strike down the enemies. If that drumbeat sounds to the honorable men, summoning them to war, will the flower-selling woman, losing her great beauty even more than us, go from house to house to sell her flowers, saying 'this is my duty'? Pitiable indeed is she!","modern":"மார்பில் படும் அடிக்கு அஞ்சாத யானையின் மேல் இருக்கும் தலைவனுடைய, பகைவர்களைத் தாக்குமாறு ஏவும் போர் முரசு, மானமுள்ள வீரர்களுக்கு ஒலிக்குமானால், எங்களைக் காட்டிலும் தன் பேரழகை இழந்து, 'இதுவே என் தொழில்' என்று கூறி, அந்தப் பூ விற்கும் பெண் பிறருடைய வீடுகளுக்குள் நுழைவாளோ? அந்தப் பூ விற்கும் பெண் மிகவும் இரங்கத்தக்கவள் ஆவாள்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Kāñci tiṇai and the theme of Pūkkōṭ Kāñci, which deals with the defense of a fort and the taking up of flowers for battle. The poet, Nocci Niyamaṅkiḻār, expresses deep pity for a flower-selling woman during a time of war. When the commander beats the battle drum, honorable warriors are summoned to fight and face death. The poet laments that as these men go to war, the flower-selling woman will lose her livelihood and her youthful beauty due to grief and poverty. He wonders if she will be forced to go from house to house to sell her flowers just to survive, highlighting the tragic human cost of warfare.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,1.6],[1.6,1.9],[1.9,3.07],[3.4,3.7],[3.7,3.8],[3.8,4.1],[4.1,5.6],[5.6,5.93],[6.1,6.5],[6.5,7.53],[7.53,8.3],[8.3,8.59],[8.77,9.0],[9.0,9.7],[9.7,10.1],[10.1,10.8],[10.8,11.1],[11.1,11.35],[11.6,12.6],[12.6,12.9],[12.9,13.47],[13.47,13.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,3.2],[3.2,3.6],[3.6,3.7],[3.7,4.0],[4.0,5.6],[5.6,5.87],[6.0,6.6],[6.6,7.46],[7.46,8.1],[8.1,8.39],[8.57,8.8],[8.8,9.4],[9.4,9.7],[9.7,10.4],[10.4,10.7],[10.7,11.05],[11.4,12.5],[12.5,12.7],[12.7,13.37],[13.37,13.7]]}}